1
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:19,810
Hey! Could you be quiet for a moment?

2
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:28,390
It's too noisy.

3
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,420
We can't rest!

4
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:45,740
It's okay. Don't cry.

5
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,640
Thank you, Hye Jin.

6
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:58,220
San, come here.

7
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,550
Good boy! Good job!

8
00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:03,750
You are doing excellent.

9
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:06,900
Madam, you see how he is running.

10
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:11,520
What a little man our San is.

11
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:15,960
Does your father have vascular dementia?

12
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,650
Yes.

13
00:01:17,650 --> 00:01:20,530
How about your husband?

14
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:25,610
You must make a full preparation for the parole hearing of next week.

15
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,380
Mum.

16
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:33,450
You could be released in 18 mounths.

17
00:01:34,170 --> 00:01:38,490
It's your only chance to keep your child with you.

18
00:01:38,490 --> 00:01:39,620
I know.

19
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:42,250
Hang on and keep from any trouble, please.

20
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:44,070
I will.

21
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:51,510
Ho! Why so sad?

22
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:55,730
Hit and Run girl, what makes you so pleased all the days?

23
00:01:55,730 --> 00:01:59,460
Why not share it with us?

24
00:01:59,970 --> 00:02:04,810
Giving birth to a bastard is not something decent.

25
00:02:04,810 --> 00:02:09,050
Why can't you live with most carefulness here?

26
00:02:09,050 --> 00:02:13,350
San, thanks to you, I'm so tired.

27
00:02:13,350 --> 00:02:16,470
Are you going to keep crying tonight?

28
00:02:16,470 --> 00:02:18,560
Stay away from him!

29
00:02:22,510 --> 00:02:25,590
How dare you?

30
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:27,790
What? Do you want to hit me?

31
00:02:27,790 --> 00:02:32,090
Right! You have your parole hearing coming up.

32
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:38,730
Go ahead and hit me. Hit me!

33
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:42,620
What a selfish bitch you are!

34
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:45,430
You are kept here because you killed someone.

35
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:47,770
Don't you feel sorry for your child?

36
00:02:47,770 --> 00:02:49,760
No matter how much you care for him,

37
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:54,840
he would be condemned as the son of a murderer after he is out.

38
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:57,990
Could you stop it?

39
00:02:57,990 --> 00:03:01,620
It's too much for a child.

40
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:10,970
You've got a dear friend here, except for your son.

41
00:03:10,970 --> 00:03:14,410
Why don't you live here forever?

42
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:37,240
Yoo Jung, have you considered sending San away from the jail？

43
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,040
Huh?

44
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:42,390
You can't keep him here forever.

45
00:03:48,530 --> 00:03:50,910
I gave mine up for adoption.

46
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:52,880
When I was sixteen.

47
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:55,100
I gave birth to a baby in the same jail.

48
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:58,650
I sent her away when she was 8 months old.

49
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:11,130
Don't give me that look.

50
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:14,980
That mother must be more qualified than me.

51
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:19,510
It's better for her to stay away from this jail.

52
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:24,470
But a mother should take care of her own baby.

53
00:04:24,470 --> 00:04:28,030
Hye Jin, I'm sure you would be a good mother.

54
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:35,260
San has a father.

55
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:39,040
He has a father and a grandfather.

56
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:43,400
I'm not sending him anywhere.

57
00:04:45,530 --> 00:04:47,270
Damn.

58
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:50,050
I'm sick of it.

59
00:04:57,150 --> 00:04:59,410
You can't behave like this all the time.

60
00:04:59,410 --> 00:05:01,730
I only have one day off each week.

61
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:04,320
If you come here after 9,

62
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:08,890
you need to pay me more money.

63
00:05:11,430 --> 00:05:13,900
I'm sorry.

64
00:05:43,990 --> 00:05:45,420
Have some food please.

65
00:05:45,420 --> 00:05:46,560
No.

66
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:48,680
I won't eat until Yoo Jung comes.

67
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,430
You have to eat.

68
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:52,570
No!

69
00:05:57,460 --> 00:05:59,160
A letter?

70
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:04,570
If you eat, I'll read it to you.

71
00:06:04,570 --> 00:06:07,730
Read it first.

72
00:06:25,180 --> 00:06:30,330
Dad. Do Hoon.

73
00:06:36,450 --> 00:06:43,230
Dad, have you had meals regularly? Have you taken medicine in time?

74
00:06:43,230 --> 00:06:48,440
Try not to give the nurse a hard time, please.

75
00:06:50,370 --> 00:06:53,740
I'm a picky eater as you,

76
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:56,430
but the food here is really good.

77
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:59,840
You might find me round when I return.

78
00:07:01,890 --> 00:07:04,180
Every day I'm learning something new.

79
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:06,820
So everyday is new and fun.

80
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:11,720
Dad, please exercise regularly and keep fit.

81
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:16,780
I'm working well with my roommates.

82
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:22,150
Don't worry about me. Please take good care of yourself.

83
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:26,330
Oops! Yoo Jung, you dropped something.

84
00:07:26,330 --> 00:07:28,720
No. 2014, what are you doing?

85
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:32,240
It's a diaper. Do you want me to have it?

86
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,650
But it's too small for me.

87
00:07:34,650 --> 00:07:36,390
His diaper.

88
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:43,260
Please take good care of it.

89
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:52,400
Do Hoon, San is a big boy now.

90
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:55,810
He was jogging around yesterday.

91
00:07:55,810 --> 00:07:59,480
We have taken a photo.

92
00:08:00,780 --> 00:08:07,780
I hope all three of us can take a picture together. I can't wait to run into that day.

93
00:08:08,330 --> 00:08:10,720
I love you.

94
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:14,000
Please take good care of my dad.

95
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,170
I'll write again.

96
00:09:40,970 --> 00:09:44,250
We can eat at a restaurant there.

97
00:09:44,250 --> 00:09:47,840
Don't be silly. Why waste money?

98
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:50,210
That's why we still live in poverty.

99
00:09:50,210 --> 00:09:54,590
It's too expensive to eat at the airport.

100
00:09:55,550 --> 00:09:57,150
Why are you so late?

101
00:09:57,150 --> 00:10:00,250
I thought you parted with that girl very early.

102
00:10:00,250 --> 00:10:04,690
You didn't go to Yoo Jung's, did you?

103
00:10:04,690 --> 00:10:09,430
The nurse is taking care of him. Why you have to be there.

104
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:13,480
Please buy something good with it.

105
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,180
It's been a while since you went on a trip.

106
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:17,590
It's okay. We don't need money.

107
00:10:17,590 --> 00:10:20,840
Your salary isn't high enough.

108
00:10:26,190 --> 00:10:28,770
Just forget about Yoo Jung.

109
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:30,800
We've done enough.

110
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:33,110
We took care of her father at the hospital,

111
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:35,240
and gave money to the victim's family.

112
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:37,920
Yoo Jung has little to say about us.

113
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:40,970
Please stop it! Yoo Jung didn't mean to hit someone.

114
00:10:40,970 --> 00:10:45,690
I don't care. I just won't let you marry someone with a criminal record.

115
00:10:45,690 --> 00:10:49,530
You're a prosecutor and she's murderer.

116
00:10:49,530 --> 00:10:51,270
No way.

117
00:10:51,270 --> 00:10:54,510
I'd made it clear.

118
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:58,790
I feel bad for Yoo Jung's father.

119
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:02,140
Some day ago, he said would join me on the trip to Jeju Island this autumn.

120
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:04,840
Why am I always the bad person?

121
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:08,120
Do you think I'm enjoying this?

122
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:11,150
Do Hoon, listen to me carefully.

123
00:11:11,150 --> 00:11:12,840
Don't trap yourself by love or anything elae.

124
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:15,520
Both of you would be painful by the end.

125
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:19,900
Trust me this time.

126
00:11:20,870 --> 00:11:22,220
Are you leaving?

127
00:11:22,220 --> 00:11:23,790
You told me your flight would be depart at 8:30.

128
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:26,890
Your father can't walk fast. We could wait at the airport.

129
00:11:26,890 --> 00:11:29,830
We haven't taken plane before. I don't want any trouble of missing our flight.

130
00:11:29,830 --> 00:11:31,960
What are you waiting for? Come on.

131
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,280
Okay.

132
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:36,510
See you later.

133
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:51,520
Listen to me, Yoo Jung.

134
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:56,350
I was poked a lot by the stuff hidden on my chest.

135
00:11:56,350 --> 00:12:00,270
Some bumps appear.

136
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:03,170
You owe me a box of coffee.

137
00:12:03,170 --> 00:12:05,010
I know.

138
00:12:12,140 --> 00:12:14,780
It turns out that everybody is rich, except me.

139
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:16,920
You would buy this and that.

140
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:19,400
I'm the only poor one.

141
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:23,890
So you see, people must find a good God.

142
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:26,180
I mean a good mum.

143
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:28,370
Before was born to the world,

144
00:12:28,370 --> 00:12:32,270
you should be in the right womb.

145
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:38,920
Look at him. He's dumping his girl.

146
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:41,120
Don't be fooled by guys like him.

147
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:43,740
I was fooled many times.

148
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:52,700
Yoo Jung, do you know why she's here?

149
00:12:53,130 --> 00:12:55,770
She sold fake drugs.

150
00:12:55,770 --> 00:12:58,550
She even fed her own child with sleeping pills,

151
00:12:58,550 --> 00:13:01,880
so that she could do night works.

152
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:05,100
She's a complete lunatic.

153
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:07,480
They'd bring boxes of beer at night.

154
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:09,810
A lot of beers.

155
00:13:20,970 --> 00:13:23,830
-46 -46

156
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:29,240
It'll be done by tomorrow.

157
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:32,710
I'll get it ready before the ceremony, master.

158
00:13:35,780 --> 00:13:40,240
Congressman Shin would celebrate his 4th term on office tonight, at our hotel.

159
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:43,980
Everybody's been telling me that all the day.

160
00:13:43,980 --> 00:13:47,060
Please make another set for me.

161
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:14,970
What are you doing here?

162
00:14:14,970 --> 00:14:17,730
What kind of thing could it be? I'm here to see you.

163
00:14:17,730 --> 00:14:20,180
I'm tired of your lies.

164
00:14:20,180 --> 00:14:23,710
Did you ever come to me without a purpose?

165
00:14:24,290 --> 00:14:25,590
What are you busy with?

166
00:14:25,590 --> 00:14:27,260
Whenever my father has a ceremony,

167
00:14:27,260 --> 00:14:30,540
he wants to show off his well-dressed daughter.

168
00:14:30,540 --> 00:14:33,640
I've to get dressed and leave. Tell me your what you what.

169
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:37,010
I thought your father hoped us to get married soon,

170
00:14:37,010 --> 00:14:39,630
but it's not the case.

171
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:42,260
You've changed.

172
00:14:42,260 --> 00:14:44,760
You weren't interested in this matter at all.

173
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:47,040
I haven't changed.

174
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:51,430
I'm just learning to live as my father's son.

175
00:14:51,430 --> 00:14:55,320
Don't worry. He's having the ceremony at your hotel.

176
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:58,230
That means he hopes us to be together still.

177
00:14:58,230 --> 00:15:00,880
I have to go.

178
00:15:04,450 --> 00:15:07,510
Are you still doing this?

179
00:15:09,070 --> 00:15:12,440
It's my father's main project.

180
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,190
What?

181
00:15:14,190 --> 00:15:19,260
I want to participate as well.

182
00:15:23,550 --> 00:15:27,560
It seems you are a good man, prosecutor.

183
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:33,430
You can't smoke here.

184
00:15:36,910 --> 00:15:41,270
I think smokers' rights are completely ignored.

185
00:15:41,270 --> 00:15:42,650
Don't you agree?

186
00:15:42,650 --> 00:15:45,880
Ms. Park, you are not here for fun.

187
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:48,280
The alcohol concentration in your blood is 1.13.

188
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:50,460
8 cars are hit by you.

189
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:52,910
2 stores are damaged by you.

190
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:56,630
You could've killed someone.

191
00:15:56,630 --> 00:15:59,230
Good to see you again, Prosecutor Ahn.

192
00:15:59,230 --> 00:16:01,580
The victims all agreed to cut a deal with us.

193
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:04,880
None of them want to press charges against her.

194
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:08,800
These are papers signed by them.

195
00:16:09,380 --> 00:16:10,420
Mr. Kim.

196
00:16:10,420 --> 00:16:13,200
Thank you for everything. Prosecutor Ahn.

197
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,790
We can go now. Miss.

198
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:19,450
We'll leave you with your work.

199
00:16:19,450 --> 00:16:21,650
Don't you move? Let me in.

200
00:16:21,650 --> 00:16:23,940
Where is Ahn Do Hoon?

201
00:16:24,990 --> 00:16:27,620
I said move!

202
00:16:28,970 --> 00:16:31,880
I don't owe anything to this country.

203
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:36,620
Very well. Let me enjoy the free food in jail. Move!

204
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:40,430
Mr. Kim Sang Bum, you are intoxicated for your interview?

205
00:16:40,430 --> 00:16:43,210
So, put me in jail please.

206
00:16:43,210 --> 00:16:46,260
The life is boring. I'm tired of it.

207
00:16:46,260 --> 00:16:48,290
Put me in jail right away, please.

208
00:16:48,290 --> 00:16:50,930
Let me go! Come on!

209
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:06,050
Do Hoon, don't forget tonight's date.

210
00:17:06,050 --> 00:17:09,310
I've done a lot of work to settle it for you.

211
00:17:10,930 --> 00:17:13,030
My father was a technician.

212
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:15,860
Yet he has been out of work for a while.

213
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:20,440
My mother raised me up by working as a casual labor.

214
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:22,880
You became a prosecutor in that family.

215
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,580
Your parents must be proud.

216
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:29,250
Yes, I'm their only hope.

217
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:32,310
I've to look after them after get married.

218
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:35,570
Since my pre-marrige time is short if I marry you,

219
00:17:35,570 --> 00:17:39,130
I prefer to live apart from your parents.

220
00:17:39,130 --> 00:17:43,330
I guess we are not fit for each other.

221
00:17:44,770 --> 00:17:52,430
Since you wasted my time, you don't mind paying for my coffee, right?

222
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:12,530
Is that a blind date?

223
00:18:12,530 --> 00:18:14,560
Hi.

224
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:18,320
She dumped you, right?

225
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:22,610
This place is filled with girls like her at this time each day.

226
00:18:22,610 --> 00:18:25,600
She doesn't deserve a prosecutor.

227
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:27,380
Forget about her.

228
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:29,840
I'm fine.

229
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:32,940
I thought you are uninterested in girls.

230
00:18:32,940 --> 00:18:35,760
Maybe I was wrong.

231
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:39,210
Shall I set you up with someone?

232
00:18:51,460 --> 00:18:52,850
Shina Foundation

233
00:18:52,850 --> 00:18:54,270
Umm.

234
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:58,470
I saw you several times in free service.

235
00:18:58,470 --> 00:19:01,650
You didn't recognize me.

236
00:19:02,370 --> 00:19:05,450
I'm sorry.

237
00:19:06,330 --> 00:19:07,740
Never mind.

238
00:19:07,740 --> 00:19:13,750
You were always alone and not interested in media

239
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:17,220
Your sincerity makes you look cool.

240
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:20,520
See you next time.

241
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:59,120
Thank you for coming.

242
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:02,680
Congratulations!

243
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:09,970
Water! Give me some water!

244
00:20:09,970 --> 00:20:11,810
Ok.

245
00:20:26,210 --> 00:20:28,860
Shin Sang Ho, that bastard!

246
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:32,530
How dare he treat us like this? Is K Hotel some little inn?

247
00:20:32,530 --> 00:20:34,850
Thanks to his rich parents he holds the position.

248
00:20:34,850 --> 00:20:36,770
Can't he be modest?

249
00:20:36,770 --> 00:20:38,030
How much we spend?

250
00:20:38,030 --> 00:20:41,800
All the expense on grand ballroom rent, food and personnel reception added,

251
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:44,450
is about 200 million and 3 thousand KRW.

252
00:20:44,450 --> 00:20:47,840
Put it under his name.

253
00:20:47,840 --> 00:20:50,350
I'll collect it whatever it takes.

254
00:20:50,350 --> 00:20:54,010
Yet keep in silence in front of him.

255
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:57,470
That's why he's escalating his exploitation on us.

256
00:20:57,470 --> 00:20:59,020
Min Hyuk.

257
00:20:59,020 --> 00:21:02,460
You've been putting your marriage off for so long.

258
00:21:02,460 --> 00:21:04,550
You think it's a trade? Are you waiting for any appreciation in value?

259
00:21:04,550 --> 00:21:06,640
It's a trade.

260
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:10,340
My marriage services for our merger and acquisition. I thought everybody knew it.

261
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:12,000
You're right.

262
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:17,080
Regard it as your first business deal.

263
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:20,620
Get Se Yeon, no matter what.

264
00:21:21,660 --> 00:21:25,440
You prepare for Min Hyuk's inauguration.

265
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:26,480
Ok.

266
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:30,240
Congressmen Kim Chang Suk must be invited to the inauguration.

267
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:34,030
He won over Congressman Shin in this general election.

268
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:35,590
Congressman Shin won't be happy.

269
00:21:35,590 --> 00:21:39,180
That's why I'm inviting him.

270
00:21:41,870 --> 00:21:48,610
I guess Min Hyuk knows what I'm up to.

271
00:22:09,810 --> 00:22:14,550
Parole hearing candidate...

272
00:22:14,550 --> 00:22:19,260
Are you eager to regain your freedom with your bloody hands?

273
00:22:30,030 --> 00:22:33,100
It's not the rule.

274
00:22:49,240 --> 00:23:03,410
-Here you go. -Here you go. -Here you go. -Here you go.

275
00:23:10,530 --> 00:23:14,200
San, say thank you to prosecutor. Say it.

276
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:16,150
Try to say it.

277
00:23:26,540 --> 00:23:32,070
Thank you, sir. Are you married?

278
00:23:32,070 --> 00:23:34,270
Move on, old lady.

279
00:23:34,270 --> 00:23:37,300
Move! Give me full spoons of meat.

280
00:23:37,540 --> 00:23:38,730
Here you go.

281
00:23:38,730 --> 00:23:41,410
Give me more than her.

282
00:23:41,410 --> 00:23:43,630
More than her.

283
00:23:43,990 --> 00:23:45,990
Ok. Ok.

284
00:23:58,510 --> 00:24:01,220
Anyone need more, let me know.

285
00:24:01,220 --> 00:24:02,920
Water. Water. Water.

286
00:24:02,920 --> 00:24:05,510
- I'll get it - OK. Good.

287
00:24:28,420 --> 00:24:31,570
Crazy bitch! You're head over heels at the sight of man.

288
00:24:31,570 --> 00:24:34,810
Think about your son.

289
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:39,560
Just sit down. Eat your noodles with soybean paste.

290
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:45,540
Mommy! Mommy!

291
00:24:54,410 --> 00:24:56,140
Are you here just for a tour?

292
00:24:56,140 --> 00:24:58,070
Then why did you want to come?

293
00:24:58,070 --> 00:25:02,580
It's not my style to be a chameleon in public.

294
00:25:02,580 --> 00:25:04,930
They squeeze time to do free service here.

295
00:25:04,930 --> 00:25:07,140
You have no right to judge them while standing here doing nothing.

296
00:25:07,140 --> 00:25:11,310
Now I'll take care of my service as well.

297
00:25:22,730 --> 00:25:25,000
If K Hotel is willing to do that,

298
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:28,720
our reeducation targets would be denefit from it.

299
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:32,940
Most companies won't hire them due to prejudice.

300
00:25:32,940 --> 00:25:36,610
Unprejudiced project is good for the image of my company.

301
00:25:36,610 --> 00:25:38,590
It's a win-win strategy.

302
00:25:38,590 --> 00:25:41,110
Industries would be provided with qualified labors.

303
00:25:41,110 --> 00:25:45,340
K Hotel would be provided with necessary supplies.

304
00:25:45,340 --> 00:25:49,440
Our improved image would boost sellings too.

305
00:25:49,500 --> 00:25:51,050
But, sir,

306
00:25:51,360 --> 00:25:55,280
there's one condition.

307
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:56,710
Excuse me?

308
00:26:13,760 --> 00:26:15,580
What is this? Don't you like it, San?

309
00:26:18,430 --> 00:26:21,560
How wonderful if daddy could be here again next week, right?

310
00:26:22,900 --> 00:26:26,040
Do you think you would have jajangmyeon next month?

311
00:27:16,930 --> 00:27:18,650
Ready for inspection!

312
00:27:53,730 --> 00:27:55,000
No. 2008,

313
00:27:55,650 --> 00:28:00,440
you're in possession of this banned item. As a punishment, your bonus of next month would be slashed.

314
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:08,700
I told you to be careful before your parole hearing.

315
00:28:09,890 --> 00:28:12,280
I'm sorry.

316
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:17,960
I'm so sorry.

317
00:28:25,150 --> 00:28:29,530
I'm not experienced enough to be a parole officer. Why would I...

318
00:28:30,230 --> 00:28:32,050
That's what I'm wondering about.

319
00:28:32,970 --> 00:28:33,940
Excuse me?

320
00:28:34,290 --> 00:28:35,700
If it's such a surprise to you,

321
00:28:35,700 --> 00:28:38,840
why don't you talk to the person who recommended you as a parole officer?

322
00:28:55,690 --> 00:28:57,470
What a tough task.

323
00:28:57,470 --> 00:29:00,530
Arrest them and release them. What a drama!

324
00:29:01,470 --> 00:29:04,890
I've become a better actor than a prosecutor.

325
00:29:11,010 --> 00:29:13,610
That future chairman asked me to pass you this.

326
00:29:13,610 --> 00:29:15,730
Since when you've become so close?

327
00:29:22,570 --> 00:29:25,390
Prosecutor Ahn, you look serious all the time, but you are really good at finding backers.

328
00:29:28,540 --> 00:29:32,620
Icecream. I just can't stop eating it even if I'm full.

329
00:29:35,070 --> 00:29:37,880
Even if I know I would have diarrhea.

330
00:29:50,980 --> 00:29:55,900
That new painting in the lobby looks great.

331
00:29:56,710 --> 00:30:02,130
Thanks. My father is busy with an important meeting so...

332
00:30:03,510 --> 00:30:07,680
I understand your father's busy works. Don't worry.

333
00:30:10,580 --> 00:30:12,890
On my! Congressman Kim.

334
00:30:15,900 --> 00:30:19,840
Thank you for coming!

335
00:30:19,840 --> 00:30:21,440
I must be here.

336
00:30:21,680 --> 00:30:23,170
Let's go inside.

337
00:30:24,180 --> 00:30:25,510
Take care.

338
00:30:36,800 --> 00:30:42,310
I'm glad to introduce the new chairman of K Hotel, Jo Min Hyuk. Welcome.

339
00:31:19,890 --> 00:31:22,110
Action time now.

340
00:31:22,110 --> 00:31:23,520
Let's go.

341
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:25,410
Before I begin my speech,

342
00:31:26,070 --> 00:31:29,120
I want to share with you a great news.

343
00:31:29,780 --> 00:31:33,800
I'd like to introduce to you my partner. We'll run the hotel together.

344
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:57,390
The Couple of the Century.

345
00:31:57,390 --> 00:31:59,930
-Look over here. -Over here!

346
00:32:09,490 --> 00:32:12,320
What are you doing? Why didn't you tell me earlier?

347
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:13,820
It was my father's idea.

348
00:32:14,460 --> 00:32:17,050
It's a warning. Don't mess with K Corporation.

349
00:32:17,820 --> 00:32:22,060
For the K Corporation and our new chairman, Jo Min Hyuk.

350
00:32:22,590 --> 00:32:23,820
Cheers!

351
00:32:38,290 --> 00:32:42,720
Kim Chang Suk! You're under arrest for power abuse and corruption.

352
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:44,950
Corruption? What are you talking about?

353
00:32:44,950 --> 00:32:46,280
What's going on?

354
00:32:50,630 --> 00:32:53,830
He's such an actor!

355
00:33:14,030 --> 00:33:15,440
What do you think you're doing?

356
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:19,550
Are you just treating me as a fool?

357
00:33:19,550 --> 00:33:23,880
Let me get this straight. It's not between you and me, but between our fathers.

358
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:26,650
We both are treated as fools.

359
00:33:58,770 --> 00:33:59,610
Hello?

360
00:34:00,700 --> 00:34:01,720
Yes, sir.

361
00:34:02,520 --> 00:34:04,180
Please hold on.

362
00:34:05,810 --> 00:34:07,270
It's Congressman Shin.

363
00:34:15,380 --> 00:34:18,600
Hello, I heard you're busy. Why are you calling me right now?

364
00:34:21,210 --> 00:34:22,700
That's okay.

365
00:34:23,020 --> 00:34:27,160
Our reporters will write good papers about Min Hyuk's inauguration ceremony.

366
00:34:27,560 --> 00:34:30,000
You don't have to thank me.

367
00:34:31,790 --> 00:34:34,410
I'll try to make time next week.

368
00:34:36,660 --> 00:34:38,040
Ok.

369
00:34:42,980 --> 00:34:49,370
I guess he's learned how to work with me.

370
00:34:49,940 --> 00:34:52,850
If we lost Congressman Kim, we'll lost the construction project.

371
00:34:52,850 --> 00:34:57,100
All of us would die if we stay with the sunken ship.

372
00:34:58,480 --> 00:35:02,190
Find someone reliable to replace him.

373
00:35:03,310 --> 00:35:05,320
We need to get rid of him completely.

374
00:35:12,970 --> 00:35:13,970
Are you okay?

375
00:35:20,530 --> 00:35:22,200
Are you feeling manipulated?

376
00:35:22,990 --> 00:35:26,450
How long would Congressman Kim be kept for?

377
00:35:27,330 --> 00:35:32,320
Now that he's been placed under arrest, the procuratorate won't release him easily.

378
00:35:33,040 --> 00:35:34,260
Do you think so?

379
00:35:34,260 --> 00:35:38,760
It's already been broadcasted. They can't ignore the public opinion.

380
00:35:40,110 --> 00:35:41,750
Public opinion?

381
00:35:42,540 --> 00:35:44,390
Don't take that seriously.

382
00:35:44,950 --> 00:35:49,580
Only if three guys give the same remarks, the rest would trust them.

383
00:35:49,950 --> 00:35:54,900
It's never a big deal for them to find that three guys.

384
00:35:58,300 --> 00:36:01,560
I asked you if you were okay.

385
00:36:02,620 --> 00:36:06,810
Would you comfort me if I'm not.

386
00:36:16,420 --> 00:36:18,450
Have you confirm that

387
00:36:18,450 --> 00:36:20,170
the illegally paid commission turns to be slush funds?

388
00:36:20,170 --> 00:36:23,410
Evidence shows that the oversea corporates...

389
00:36:23,410 --> 00:36:28,470
The procuratorate is trying to connect it with Congressman Kim's attempt at tax evasion.

390
00:36:29,230 --> 00:36:32,790
We, the procuratorate,

391
00:36:32,790 --> 00:36:35,210
show zero tolerance to corruption, power abuse and bribe taking.

392
00:36:36,140 --> 00:36:41,040
We promise to take a neutral position in this investigation.

393
00:36:45,150 --> 00:36:46,240
Prosecutor Ahn,

394
00:36:48,960 --> 00:36:51,130
you mustn't replace lunch with icecream.

395
00:37:16,610 --> 00:37:18,310
Help! Help!

396
00:37:18,490 --> 00:37:19,770
Director

397
00:37:19,770 --> 00:37:20,900
Director

398
00:37:37,650 --> 00:37:38,720
What's going on?

399
00:37:40,220 --> 00:37:41,780
How do you feel?

400
00:37:57,110 --> 00:37:58,360
Are you okay?

401
00:38:02,580 --> 00:38:05,760
Are you trying to get yourself in trouble?

402
00:38:08,870 --> 00:38:10,300
I thought they were your friends.

403
00:38:11,990 --> 00:38:13,770
Friends, yeah right.

404
00:38:17,070 --> 00:38:20,410
Stop being a goody. You make me sick.

405
00:38:38,870 --> 00:38:40,330
Nice to meet you. Prosecutor Ahn.

406
00:38:42,300 --> 00:38:46,400
I don't like being summoned casually by you, especially when no reason is given.

407
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,700
How do you do recently?

408
00:38:48,840 --> 00:38:50,880
The judge decided he is of no guilt.

409
00:38:51,270 --> 00:38:52,480
Don't you feel out of luck?

410
00:38:53,700 --> 00:38:58,710
You were the best at the Judicial Research and Training Center. Now you just can't go well.

411
00:38:59,970 --> 00:39:01,250
It's no fun, is it?

412
00:39:02,260 --> 00:39:04,690
Your parents are so proud of you when you become a prosecutor.

413
00:39:04,690 --> 00:39:06,810
You should be ashamed.

414
00:39:07,180 --> 00:39:09,670
Because you haven't changed anything as a prosecutor.

415
00:39:09,910 --> 00:39:11,290
They must have realised it as well.

416
00:39:11,290 --> 00:39:13,110
It's none of your business.

417
00:39:13,110 --> 00:39:15,070
I feel bad for you.

418
00:39:15,070 --> 00:39:16,830
Do you think your parents would be happy

419
00:39:16,830 --> 00:39:19,080
when they find out what their precious son is doing?

420
00:39:19,080 --> 00:39:21,190
-What do you think? -Look!

421
00:39:22,830 --> 00:39:28,020
Take this, then she would never leave the jail.

422
00:39:28,020 --> 00:39:31,760
I would recommend you to your boss if you do as I tell you.

423
00:39:32,500 --> 00:39:34,390
What do you want from me?

424
00:39:47,810 --> 00:39:49,990
Yoo Jung, do your best.

425
00:39:50,990 --> 00:39:55,250
-Try to earn an abatement from penalty. -I wil.

426
00:39:55,250 --> 00:39:59,190
Please do get out of here. Stop your useless tears.

427
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:19,730
-Cheongju Correctional Institute, No. 2008! -Yes.

428
00:41:07,770 --> 00:41:12,490
Kang Yoo Jung! Kang Yoo Jung!

429
00:41:13,640 --> 00:41:15,360
Have a seat!

430
00:41:23,290 --> 00:41:28,010
- Why are you crying? - Sorry.

431
00:41:30,480 --> 00:41:33,590
I am just so sorry for those dead ones.

432
00:41:35,770 --> 00:41:37,930
Sorry.

433
00:41:40,530 --> 00:41:42,640
Kang Yoo Jung.

434
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:47,620
How do you spend the past 2 years?

435
00:41:55,680 --> 00:42:04,390
I've been working hard to make amends for my mistake.

436
00:42:05,770 --> 00:42:09,730
I've been making full use of everyday.

437
00:42:09,730 --> 00:42:13,120
I believe that's what I should do.

438
00:42:14,030 --> 00:42:17,630
-Do you have a son? -Yes.

439
00:42:17,630 --> 00:42:20,500
Is there anyone who can take care of him?

440
00:42:20,500 --> 00:42:27,330
Not really. My dad is really ill at the moment.

441
00:42:29,860 --> 00:42:34,910
What are you going to do if we grant you the parole?

442
00:42:36,980 --> 00:42:40,340
I heard that the girl hit by me has a mother

443
00:42:40,670 --> 00:42:43,760
who is still alive.

444
00:42:44,680 --> 00:42:50,730
I'm going to find her and beg for her forgiveness.

445
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:57,650
My father brought me up all by himself.

446
00:42:59,800 --> 00:43:02,180
Yet when he is ill,

447
00:43:02,180 --> 00:43:05,630
I can't stay with him and look after him.

448
00:43:07,280 --> 00:43:13,230
So if I can get out I will spend some time with my dad.

449
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:19,760
I want to sit under stars as well.

450
00:43:21,920 --> 00:43:25,480
When I'm in jail I can't be in the open air all the time.

451
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:29,630
And my son has never seen the real stars.

452
00:43:31,170 --> 00:43:36,290
I want to show the stars to my son.

453
00:43:40,940 --> 00:43:45,100
Thank you, Ms. Kang. You can go.

454
00:44:21,980 --> 00:44:24,180
What do you want from me?

455
00:44:24,180 --> 00:44:26,250
I heard that there's a parole hearing.

456
00:44:26,250 --> 00:44:28,340
You're a judge of it.

457
00:44:29,140 --> 00:44:32,330
What I want is quite simple.

458
00:44:32,330 --> 00:44:35,070
But what do you what? To be a boss or to be a follower?

459
00:44:35,070 --> 00:44:37,860
It's up to you.

460
00:44:39,650 --> 00:44:43,400
Kang Yoo Jung has been punished.

461
00:44:43,400 --> 00:44:45,610
Why are you still bullying her?

462
00:44:45,610 --> 00:44:50,930
I can't bear her happiness, when others live in misery for her.

463
00:45:05,670 --> 00:45:07,870
Would you drag your heels

464
00:45:07,870 --> 00:45:09,900
due to the lack of sufficient evidence,

465
00:45:09,900 --> 00:45:12,690
if Mr. Yun from Pyeongchang Construction refuse to be a testifier?

466
00:45:12,690 --> 00:45:14,700
Did you hear that

467
00:45:14,700 --> 00:45:17,560
Congressman Kim referred the arrest warrant as a Training Institute paper?

468
00:45:17,560 --> 00:45:19,710
Are you playing a drama or broadcasting the news?

469
00:45:19,710 --> 00:45:21,820
I guess Congressman Kim won't mind going to a Training Institute

470
00:45:21,820 --> 00:45:25,090
to become a better citizen.

471
00:45:26,780 --> 00:45:28,680
We'll make hime graduate

472
00:45:28,680 --> 00:45:31,350
before he's too tired to stand on his feet.

473
00:45:33,320 --> 00:45:37,390
Are you smiling at the news?

474
00:45:37,980 --> 00:45:40,750
Are you crazy? She must be crazy.

475
00:45:43,130 --> 00:45:47,230
Yoo Jung, are you getting out of here?

476
00:45:47,230 --> 00:45:50,200
Why are you so happy?

477
00:45:52,320 --> 00:45:55,180
I'm happy,

478
00:45:55,180 --> 00:46:01,380
because I found that I had made a right choice. I'm so glad.

479
00:46:04,560 --> 00:46:09,660
Hye Jin, I'll live with all my strength.

480
00:46:09,660 --> 00:46:13,480
I'll be a good mother for San.

481
00:46:15,020 --> 00:46:16,880
I'm sure.

482
00:46:24,470 --> 00:46:27,600
-No. 2008. You have a visitor. -Me?

483
00:46:28,550 --> 00:46:31,080
No. 2008. You have a visitor.

484
00:46:33,000 --> 00:46:34,920
Who could it be?

485
00:46:34,920 --> 00:46:40,660
- Is he San's father? - What? It can't be.

486
00:46:40,660 --> 00:46:48,160
What do you mean? Who else would come?

487
00:46:50,750 --> 00:46:53,150
That seems a young man.

488
00:46:54,700 --> 00:46:56,800
Yoo Jung, wait!

489
00:47:00,080 --> 00:47:08,190
Yoo Jung, put this on.

490
00:47:09,820 --> 00:47:12,280
Pretty.

491
00:47:16,440 --> 00:47:21,300
San, mum is going to see your father. Are you happy?

492
00:47:27,320 --> 00:47:30,080
Hye Jin, take care of San please.

493
00:48:08,790 --> 00:48:10,940
Nice to meet you again.

494
00:48:11,990 --> 00:48:14,450
Why are you here?

495
00:48:21,100 --> 00:48:28,010
Hello? Hello?

496
00:48:28,010 --> 00:48:30,900
You seem to be doing okay.

497
00:48:31,860 --> 00:48:34,140
You look good.

498
00:48:37,230 --> 00:48:39,970
Just stay in the jail and enjoy the life inside.

499
00:48:39,970 --> 00:48:43,470
Once you get out, you would find your life a real misery.

500
00:48:49,300 --> 00:48:52,730
What are you doing here?

501
00:48:52,730 --> 00:48:54,790
Why are you always against me？

502
00:48:54,790 --> 00:48:57,300
What do you want from me?

503
00:48:57,300 --> 00:48:59,690
Who are you on earth?

504
00:49:01,510 --> 00:49:05,290
You must be curious why why why...

505
00:49:08,410 --> 00:49:11,320
Take your time to think about why am I so hard on you.

506
00:49:11,830 --> 00:49:16,450
Anyway, you won't get out this time.

507
00:49:55,430 --> 00:49:58,040
Don't cry. Don't cry.

508
00:49:58,480 --> 00:50:02,810
What's wrong with my cute boy? Did you poop?

509
00:50:02,810 --> 00:50:08,020
It's okay. It's okay.

510
00:50:08,630 --> 00:50:11,800
No. 2008. Step back.

511
00:50:27,620 --> 00:50:32,300
-Take him. -San. I didn't beat him.

512
00:50:33,760 --> 00:50:39,960
San. San. Let me go.

513
00:50:39,960 --> 00:50:46,230
Madam! Madam! It's not me. What's wrong?

514
00:50:46,230 --> 00:50:49,040
No. 2008. You can't come with him. Please go by the rule.

515
00:50:49,040 --> 00:50:52,810
He was okay in the morning. I didn't do anything.

516
00:50:52,810 --> 00:50:54,670
I didn't see...

517
00:50:57,950 --> 00:51:00,370
Everybody! Keep working!

518
00:51:03,180 --> 00:51:08,060
Madam, where are you taking San? Madam?

519
00:51:11,360 --> 00:51:14,300
What's going on?

520
00:51:14,300 --> 00:51:16,140
Hye Jin, what happened to San?

521
00:51:16,140 --> 00:51:19,590
You're weird. Why are you asking me?

522
00:51:19,920 --> 00:51:22,140
You always come to me when you need me.

523
00:51:22,140 --> 00:51:25,610
- Now you blame me when something is wrong? - Hye Jin!

524
00:51:25,610 --> 00:51:29,060
I'm not his mother. You are.

525
00:51:31,990 --> 00:51:34,450
What are you doing?

526
00:51:34,450 --> 00:51:37,160
- Let me go! - Stop! Please stop!

527
00:51:38,090 --> 00:51:42,600
- You bitch! - Stop!

528
00:51:42,600 --> 00:51:45,990
Why did you do that? Answer me!

529
00:51:45,990 --> 00:51:49,490
I just want to save my life.

530
00:51:49,970 --> 00:51:55,100
- Put it down! - Let me go! - What are you doing?

531
00:51:55,100 --> 00:51:57,050
Stop! That's enough! Stop!

532
00:51:57,050 --> 00:52:01,360
You are good for nothing.

533
00:52:01,890 --> 00:52:04,350
Don't!

534
00:52:20,250 --> 00:52:23,410
Doctor, what happened to my San? Nobody is telling me why.

535
00:52:23,410 --> 00:52:26,710
- No. 2008. Stay still! - What is happening?

536
00:52:26,710 --> 00:52:28,670
Why don't you tell me anything?

537
00:52:28,670 --> 00:52:31,710
Where is my son? Where is San?

538
00:52:31,710 --> 00:52:34,720
Where is he? Where do you take him?

539
00:52:34,970 --> 00:52:38,550
Doctor, Where is my son?

540
00:52:38,780 --> 00:52:42,540
Doctor! Doctor! Doctor!

541
00:52:43,080 --> 00:52:46,210
Where is he? Where is he?

542
00:52:46,210 --> 00:52:48,640
Where is San?

543
00:52:48,640 --> 00:52:51,720
Doctor, where is my San?

544
00:52:54,530 --> 00:52:58,120
Where the hell is my son? Please tell me.

545
00:52:58,120 --> 00:53:01,570
I'm sorry. I'll apologize to anyone.

546
00:53:01,570 --> 00:53:03,450
I can't treat her here.

547
00:53:06,400 --> 00:53:07,990
Kwang Soo!

548
00:53:10,120 --> 00:53:11,520
Yes.

549
00:53:12,200 --> 00:53:15,000
Do you believe in love?

550
00:53:18,440 --> 00:53:21,970
I think I do.

551
00:53:23,630 --> 00:53:25,140
Really?

552
00:53:28,480 --> 00:53:30,900
I'll tell you something interesting.

553
00:53:33,500 --> 00:53:37,640
5 judges are in charge of Kang Yoo Jung's parole hearing. I met them all.

554
00:53:38,330 --> 00:53:41,860
Two vote pro and two vote con.

555
00:53:41,860 --> 00:53:45,080
That was what I expected. 2:2.

556
00:53:46,510 --> 00:53:51,150
I'm wondering about his choice.

557
00:53:54,370 --> 00:53:56,040
Love?

558
00:53:57,440 --> 00:53:59,790
That's a holy shit.

559
00:54:00,400 --> 00:54:03,870
Now I'm reporting investigations upon Congressman Kim,

560
00:54:03,870 --> 00:54:05,970
his secret funds and other related reports.

561
00:54:05,970 --> 00:54:07,630
As you see in the documents,

562
00:54:07,630 --> 00:54:11,780
he obtained the government's supporting appropriate through the an account.

563
00:54:11,780 --> 00:54:14,880
Since the August of 2005,

564
00:54:14,880 --> 00:54:17,560
he's been served as an adjunct director of Joeun Savings Bank.

565
00:54:17,560 --> 00:54:21,180
During the period, 15 billion secret funds was...

566
00:54:34,880 --> 00:54:37,730
Ahn Do Hoon here.

567
00:54:37,730 --> 00:54:39,830
Prosecutor.

568
00:54:42,160 --> 00:54:44,370
Prosecutor.

569
00:54:44,370 --> 00:54:46,320
Yoo Jung!

570
00:54:47,430 --> 00:54:51,020
Ms. Kang, are you okay?

571
00:54:51,610 --> 00:54:53,350
About my parole hearing...

572
00:54:53,350 --> 00:54:57,190
I see. There will be a legal consulting service for you next week...

573
00:54:57,190 --> 00:55:00,000
No, I don't care that.

574
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:01,320
I don't care about myself.

575
00:55:01,320 --> 00:55:07,260
I could stay here for the rest of my life,

576
00:55:09,330 --> 00:55:11,280
if you could get my son back.

577
00:55:11,280 --> 00:55:13,670
My son...

578
00:55:16,310 --> 00:55:19,460
They accuse me of child abuse.

579
00:55:21,170 --> 00:55:25,610
But it's not true. You know that.

580
00:55:26,160 --> 00:55:29,440
They hide San from me.

581
00:55:29,440 --> 00:55:32,930
I beg you to bring back my San. Please.

582
00:55:32,930 --> 00:55:36,740
What happened? Tell me in details.

583
00:55:37,930 --> 00:55:41,430
They said San ate something wrong.

584
00:55:43,770 --> 00:55:47,350
I don't know what's it indeed. He's bruised all over his body.

585
00:55:47,350 --> 00:55:49,650
But I don't understand.

586
00:55:49,650 --> 00:55:51,120
I know every inch of his body.

587
00:55:51,120 --> 00:55:55,020
There isn't even a single scratch. But...

588
00:55:55,020 --> 00:55:59,070
But... they said I did it.

589
00:55:59,070 --> 00:56:02,130
No. He's my child...

590
00:56:02,130 --> 00:56:03,360
I'm his mother.

591
00:56:03,360 --> 00:56:07,940
How could I do that? Why would I hurt my son?

592
00:56:07,940 --> 00:56:11,650
Calm down and listen to me.

593
00:56:11,650 --> 00:56:14,520
I'll find out what happened.

594
00:56:14,520 --> 00:56:16,490
Be patient and wait for my call.

595
00:56:16,490 --> 00:56:18,410
Do you understand?

596
00:56:18,410 --> 00:56:21,030
I'll find out what happened.

597
00:56:21,940 --> 00:56:27,190
Please. Please....

598
00:56:29,430 --> 00:56:30,910
Do Hoon.

599
00:56:31,720 --> 00:56:35,370
They took our son.

600
00:56:41,030 --> 00:56:44,060
Do Hoon! Do Hoon!

601
00:56:44,060 --> 00:56:45,320
Do Hoon!

602
00:56:46,270 --> 00:56:48,020
Do Hoon!

603
00:56:50,330 --> 00:56:54,390
No. 2008. Time's up.

604
00:56:55,600 --> 00:56:57,250
No. 2008!

605
00:56:59,250 --> 00:57:00,440
Get out!

606
00:57:03,570 --> 00:57:05,930
-Get out! -Let me go.

607
00:57:06,330 --> 00:57:09,280
You get out! Out!

608
00:57:09,910 --> 00:57:12,550
Don't touch me!

609
00:57:12,550 --> 00:57:14,360
Don't touch me!

610
00:57:14,580 --> 00:57:16,530
Keep away from me!

611
00:57:17,030 --> 00:57:19,800
Let me go! Let me go!

612
00:57:37,160 --> 00:57:39,850
Prosecutor Ahn, are you okay?

613
00:57:40,760 --> 00:57:42,970
What should we do with it?

614
00:58:16,930 --> 00:58:18,600
What?

615
00:58:19,200 --> 00:58:21,340
Jesus.

616
00:58:26,120 --> 00:58:31,340
Madam, why are you taking San's stuff?

617
00:58:31,340 --> 00:58:34,610
Yoo Jung made it.

618
00:58:40,300 --> 00:58:41,800
Well...

619
00:58:49,630 --> 00:58:53,610
You're here. I was waiting for you all the time.

620
00:58:53,610 --> 00:58:56,010
We need to finish our talk.

621
00:58:56,010 --> 00:58:58,550
We've nothing to talk anout.

622
00:58:58,900 --> 00:59:02,540
And, goodbye forever.

623
00:59:11,100 --> 00:59:15,930
I'm transferring to the vocational training center.

624
00:59:15,930 --> 00:59:21,820
I'm learning some vocational skills before my parole.

625
01:00:56,610 --> 01:00:58,340
What is it?

626
01:01:02,180 --> 01:01:05,630
Take it. I appreciate you a lot.

627
01:01:09,630 --> 01:01:11,250
You don't have to.

628
01:01:11,250 --> 01:01:14,090
Time could change everything.

629
01:01:14,530 --> 01:01:18,460
Last two years past like one single moment.

630
01:01:19,220 --> 01:01:21,070
I hope she could be released as soon as possible.

631
01:01:21,070 --> 01:01:25,310
By then I would make her the most miserable woman in the world.

632
01:01:25,310 --> 01:01:30,790
In fact, occasionally I feel it's no bad to trap her in that jail forever.

633
01:01:34,240 --> 01:01:37,690
Who else would listen to those nonsense? It's nice to have you sit here.

634
01:01:37,690 --> 01:01:40,110
Prosecutor Ahn, you're like my friend.

635
01:01:40,110 --> 01:01:42,510
Not to mention that you always do what I wanna do.

636
01:01:43,430 --> 01:01:45,470
Let's be friends.

637
01:01:47,720 --> 01:01:53,190
Friendship is a mutual thing. We don't have such things.

638
01:01:53,190 --> 01:01:57,010
Then, what's your opinion?

639
01:04:13,720 --> 01:04:15,790
Yoo Jung!

640
01:04:58,970 --> 01:05:01,400
Ms. Kang Yoo Jung.

641
01:05:02,140 --> 01:05:07,740
What are you going to do if you are released?

642
01:05:08,710 --> 01:05:10,510
To sit under stars.

643
01:05:11,600 --> 01:05:19,030
When I was in the sport field, I realised that my son hasn't seen any real star since born.

644
01:05:20,500 --> 01:05:26,650
I want show him real stars.

645
01:06:09,090 --> 01:06:11,300
Next on Secret Love...

646
01:06:11,300 --> 01:06:14,760
Do Hoon, we have to find San.

647
01:06:14,760 --> 01:06:17,560
I've forgiven her. Now I'm relaxed.

648
01:06:24,210 --> 01:06:26,350
Who is he?

649
01:06:26,350 --> 01:06:27,700
He is a prosecutor named Ahn Do Hoon.

650
01:06:27,700 --> 01:06:30,310
Mr. Jo Min Hyuk, there is a search warrant against you.

651
01:06:30,310 --> 01:06:31,670
Let's go, dad.

652
01:06:31,670 --> 01:06:36,310
I know you are the murder. You make Yoo Jung a scapgoat.

653
01:06:36,310 --> 01:06:38,260
You just wait and see.
